.TH std::extents::dynamic-index 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::extents::dynamic-index \- std::extents::dynamic-index

.SH Synopsis
private:                                                          (since C++23)
static constexpr auto /*dynamic-index*/( rank_type i ) noexcept;  (exposition only*)

Returns the number of dynamic extents below index i. If i <= rank() is false, the behavior
is undefined.

.SH Parameters

i - the index

.SH Return value

The number of E[r] with r < i for which E[r] is a dynamic extent.

